    "description": "Join the Speed Post India Advisory Limited family as a Distribution Manager in Ranchi. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout Speed Post India Advisory Limited:\nSpeed Post India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in INCOTERMS\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Referral bonus program\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ranchi, Jharkhand, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Speed Post India Advisory Limited!",
